lName` template\r\n- Updated the PR to address some changes that have occurred since the PR was originally made\r\n- Quoted label `app.kubernetes.io/version` as the required type is string\r\n\r\n* Update mojaloop-simulator/templates/_helpers.tpl\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Matt Kingston <mattkingston@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* Update mojaloop-simulator/templates/_helpers.tpl\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Matt Kingston <mattkingston@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* Minor clean-up\r\n\r\n* Retain original ingressPathRewriteRegex and defer to deployment values file instead\r\n\r\n* Align labels\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: msk- <mattkingston@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "8952c66745dde99110721b1e52e3e3e30007d5c8", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mojaloop/helm/git/trees/8952c66745dde99110721b1e52e3e3e30007d5c8"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mojaloop/helm/git/commits/9c478e223e725f16bd7aecff52bdad0a6f13ddbb", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJesoAMCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAKrg2Ma3mliyC/Y8L1Blc4El\nStK0Nn0iOt4Cpd0Xa31VrDPFMcXEq5AfzDtzNEnZpZuJuuVbYvwkbcyYHn6s6tYR\nwLndHixzmvtMSt0iqx0seOA9q4ttKpu0wVQey3tfKOP046fDOZQuugbIDSsiP6V7\nO059/UIRD7hbrQM5aT07Pr5aIVvThfU5nskcJj2ZPA+oKPexj6I9XEqqJjrNhoJm\nXC3wiQe1Hep6ZbeHbp7gFNgt0y2Z0TWBmO2vai4cJUzuptKNq0sfI/+Y+VZyv5Nn\nkDf79x8EiktrMgb+pDFYEVKxXe1f4pivotTQDEBDYajb2y8lVnehIAd4gyoqzK4=\n=b9yO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 8952c66745dde99110721b1e52e3e3e30007d5c8\nparent 44cd91329066d33de56b8054749055b4a3919d70\nauthor Steven Oderayi <oderayi@gmail.com> 1588756492 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1588756492 +0100\n\nFeature/#1125: Updates for Mojaloop Simulator (#299)\n\n* Introduce 'prefix' to allow for flexibility in component names and url.\r\n\r\n* Fix default prefix\r\n\r\n* Minor fix\r\n\r\n* Fix for python in ci\r\n\r\n* Fix linting error\r\n\r\n* Make ingressPathRewriteRegex compatible with core OSS env\r\n\r\n* Ensure pods ar